cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Pedigree or its figures, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Pedigree: the licence terms an open model inherits"
abstract: >-
  Pedigree walks an open model's family tree on Hugging Face (fine-tunes, adapters, merges, quantisations) and reports
  which licence terms it inherits, from which ancestor and under which clause. The lineage of 213,928 models, built
  from a pinned snapshot of 914,842 Hub model cards, is one Relate by Neo4j file; the checks run in Cypher, in a
  coding-agent hook before a download, over MCP and in the browser.
authors:
  - family-names: Donovici
    given-names: Marc
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Marc-Dvci/pedigree"
url: "https://marc-dvci.github.io/pedigree/"
keywords:
  - open models
  - model licences
  - Hugging Face
  - lineage
  - Relate
  - Neo4j
  - Cypher
  - MCP
